From 4a1689252f97ff4dfcd53a076af03b4abe91bf08 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Sebastian=20Dr=C3=B6ge?= <sebastian@centricular.com>
Date: Thu, 11 Jun 2026 15:31:55 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] rmdemux: Check that enough data is available before parsing
 header data

And skip over invalid header packets.

Fixes https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/gstreamer/gstreamer/-/work_items/5039
Fixes https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/gstreamer/gstreamer/-/work_items/5038

Part-of: <https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/gstreamer/gstreamer/-/merge_requests/11825>
---
 .../gst-plugins-ugly/gst/realmedia/rmdemux.c  | 301 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++------------
 .../gst-plugins-ugly/gst/realmedia/rmdemux.h  |   2 +-
 2 files changed, 213 insertions(+), 90 deletions(-)

diff --git a/subprojects/gst-plugins-ugly/gst/realmedia/rmdemux.c b/subprojects/gst-plugins-ugly/gst/realmedia/rmdemux.c
index 19beb51..a453230 100644
--- a/subprojects/gst-plugins-ugly/gst/realmedia/rmdemux.c
+++ b/subprojects/gst-plugins-ugly/gst/realmedia/rmdemux.c
